  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Facilitating tiger population recovery through threat mitigation in Telangana, India</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to, (1) Aid habitat consolidation through facilitating voluntary resettlement of local communities from tiger reserves of Telangana, (2) Mitigate threats to tiger survival through supporting anti-poaching activities of the government within reserves and community-based measures in corridors, and, (3) Continue scientific and conservation support to Telangana Forest department as an outside expert.</narrative>
  </description>
